#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Dtc"
msgstr "Instalação do Dtc"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>dtc</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>dtc</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:84
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"            -D python=disabled .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"            -D python=disabled .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#.  https://github.com/dgibson/dtc/commit/32174a66efa4
#.       Two tests named <filename>
#. cell-overflow.dts</filename> and
#.       <filename>cell-overflow-results.dts</filename> are known to fail.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>meson test -v</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>meson test -v</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:105
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid "Still as the &root; user, remove the useless static library:"
msgstr ""
"Ainda como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, remova a biblioteca estática inútil:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:111
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm /usr/lib/libfdt.a</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm /usr/lib/libfdt.a</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='texlive'/> installed, you can build the PDF "
"format of the documentation by issuing the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='texlive'/> instalado, poderá construir o "
"formato PDF da documentação emitindo o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd ../Documentation\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper &amp;&amp;\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper -c\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd ../Documentation\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper &amp;&amp;\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper -c\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To install the documentation, as the &root; user issue the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"Para instalar a documentação, como o(a) usuário(a) &root; emita o seguinte "
"comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:128
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -R ../Documentation -T /usr/share/doc/dtc-&dtc-"
"version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -R ../Documentation -T /usr/share/doc/dtc-&dtc-"
"version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend='swig'/> and you wish to install the "
"Python 3 binding of this package, build the Python 3 module:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado <xref linkend='swig'/> e desejar instalar a ligação "
"Python 3 desse pacote, construa o módulo Python 3:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&build-wheel-cmd; ..</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>&build-wheel-cmd; ..</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid "As the &root; user, install the Python 3 module:"
msgstr "Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, instale o módulo Python 3:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:142
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&install-wheel; libfdt</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>&install-wheel; libfdt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D python=disabled</parameter>: This switch prevents building the"
" Python 3 binding with the deprecated method (running "
"<command>setup.py</command> directly).  We will build the Python 3 binding "
"with the <command>pip3 wheel</command> command separately if wanted."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D python=disabled</parameter>: Essa chave impede construir a "
"ligação do Python 3 com o método obsoleto (executando "
"<command>setup.py</command> diretamente). Nós construiremos a ligação do "
"Python 3 com o comando <command>pip3 wheel</command> separadamente, se "
"desejado."

